1|0@Standup^1440015425#cu8o60t:funnymatt$:I know why people start tweets with periods- if you want to mention @cinnabon on Twitter, and you start your tweet with @cinnabon, it will only be seen by people who follow @cinnabon. But if you start it as .@cinnabon (or any other characters before the username mention, but a period is what is commonly used) all of your followers will see it, regardless of whether they follow @cinnabon or not.
